  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      582.59,
      286.64,
      709.79
    ],
    "text": "Description of the lands to be acquired : An allotment of land extended 3.9975 Hectares, mentioned in the Preliminary Survey plan bearing No. GAM. 4229 dated 26.01.2021, prepared by Senior Superintendent of Surveys, Gampaha instead of Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Welikadamulla in Walikadamulla Grama Niladhari Division, No. 363, in Attanagalla Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Gampaha District, Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
