    ],
    "text": "N.B.\u2014 Since, it has been decided to redemption the plot of land called Lot No. 14 in the Preliminary Survey plan bearing No. GAM. 4229, under the Section No. 39 (a), 0.9314 Hectares has been deducted out of the whole extend of 4.9289 Hectares of the plan.",
